        "id": "what-astryx-guarantees",
        "title": "What Astryx Guarantees",
        "package": "@astryxdesign/cli",
        "summary": "Components never throw on missing platform APIs. Where a browser lacks the `Popover` API, layers fall back to plain visibility instead of crashing."
      },
      {
        "id": "the-on-screen-keyboard",
        "title": "The On-Screen Keyboard",
        "package": "@astryxdesign/cli",
        "summary": "On a phone, the components that respond to the on-screen keyboard, a fully expanded `height='tall'` BottomSheet and ChatLayout's composer, measure it the same way: the layout viewport's height minus the visual viewport's height times its…"
