      {
        "id": "supporting-older-browsers",
        "title": "Supporting Older Browsers",
        "package": "@astryxdesign/cli",
        "summary": "If your audience includes Tier 2 browsers and you need correct layer positioning, you have three options, cheapest first. All of them are decisions you make for your audience; Astryx does not impose one."
